=====================================================================
WHAT WOULD MAKE THIS PASS
=====================================================================
One clause, at warnings_client_regression_test.go:35-38. Delete
  "even a warm test cache (this test execs node and reads a file outside its
   package directory, so the cache never replays it)"
from the covered list. If a cache sentence is wanted at all, the checkable one
is: "A warm test cache is invalidated when the PATH string changes -- which is
how node normally disappears -- and when accounts.html or the harness JS is
edited, because both sit under the module root; a cached green result is NOT
invalidated by node being removed at an unchanged PATH." Nothing else in
attempt 6 needs to change: items 1, 2, 4 (both original findings), 5, 6, 7 and
8 all pass, and the two claims I failed at attempt 5 are correctly and
verifiably fixed.
